# Cursor Rules - Kanban Tray

# CRITICAL TASK PROTOCOL:
# Never edit tasks.json directly using file writing or editing tools.
# Always run deterministic CLI commands:
# - npm run task -- list
# - npm run task -- start <id>
# - npm run task -- done <id>
# - npm run task -- move <id> <status>
# - npm run task -- add "<Title>" ["<Description>"] [low|medium|high]
# - npm run task -- delete <id>

# Refer to .ai-rules/tarefas_para_hoje.md for detailed documentation.
